How to use this

Just clone the cports repo (https://github.com/chimera-linux/cports) to your home directory,
run ./cbuild keygen, ./cbuild binary-bootstrap and ./cbuild clean for bootstrap start environment and clean it,
copy neuswc and neuwld to ~/cports/user,
run ./cbuild relink-subpkgs, and
run ./cbuild pkg user/neuswc (neuwld will be builded too as the neuswc dependency)

Your builded packages repo will be stored in ~/cports/packages/user
